摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH web plugin: pick skills from a sidebar and inject them into the current session.","id":"gh:1340794741","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-skill-select","slug":"wyzh0117/dsh-skill-select","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","skill"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH web plugin: pick skills from a sidebar and inject them into the current session."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-SkillSelect"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English · 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DSH web plugin: pick installed skills from a sidebar and inject them into the current session."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- Lists every configured skill. Marks **Global**, and a **repo** label when it can be inferred.\n- **"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"Skills**: session-only checks. A skill appends `/skill-name` to the composer; a fully checked repo w"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"rites `/repo` and expands on send. Hiding and reopening the tab clears this session's checks.\n- **Au"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"to-start**: persistent defaults, injected once on the first message of each session. Same grouping a"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"nd checkboxes as Skills.\n- Sort: **Repo** (default) / **Name** / **Most used** / **Source**. Repo an"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"d Source views fold by group.\n- **Guard** (off by default): when on, model `skill` tool calls outsid"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"e Auto-start ∪ this session's picks are rejected. Typed `/skill` is never blocked.\n- Uses frontmatte"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"r `description` when present; otherwise generates one English line and caches it. Never writes skill"},{"id":"p6s9","text":" files.\n- Also lists Codex / Grok / Hermes user skills (builtins skipped). Duplicates across agents "},{"id":"p6s10","text":"are listed separately. Checks write `/name@agent`; the plugin injects that source's `SKILL.md`. Thes"},{"id":"p6s11","text":"e are **not** registered in the model's `available_skills`.\n- **Update** runs `git pull` on git-back"},{"id":"p6s12","text":"ed skills and re-fetches skills with a per-skill origin marker. Root-level markers and skills with n"},{"id":"p6s13","text":"o source are skipped. A changelog appears in the panel."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Web profile only."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`, then hard-refresh the browser (`Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+R`)."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## DSH compatibility"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Plugin | DSH | Notes |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| **0.2.0** (current) | `^0.2.0-rc.2` | Registers against the official right sidebar (see below). |\n"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"| 0.1.1 | `^0.1.0-rc.6 \\|\\| ^0.1.5-rc.1` | Last release for the 0.1.x lines; on 0.2.x the peer gate "},{"id":"p13s3","text":"below skips it silently. |\n| 0.1.0 | `^0.1.0-rc.6` | **Broken on 0.1.5+** — see below. |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**dsh 0.2.0-rc.2 gates compatibility hard.** `dsh-app-boot` reads the\n`package.json` `peerDependenci"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"es` whose name is `@deepseek-ai/dsh` or starts\nwith `@deepseek-ai/dsh-`, runs\n`semver.satisfies(runt"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"imeVersion, range, { includePrerelease: true })`, and on\nany failure it **skips the whole bundle**: "},{"id":"p14s4","text":"the module is never imported and the\nplugin row shows as disabled — silently. **If the plugin stops "},{"id":"p14s5","text":"loading after a\nDSH upgrade, check these peer ranges against `dsh --version` first.**\n`engines.dsh` "},{"id":"p14s6","text":"in `dsh.plugin.json` is not enforced in rc.2 (kept as metadata\nonly). Forced-load escape hatch when "},{"id":"p14s7","text":"you really must: `dsh plugin\nallow-version`, which writes `<profile>/compatibility.json`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**rc.2 also split session reads into two tracks.** `ctx.sessions` is now an\nin-memory store of **liv"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"e** sessions: `sessions.get(id)` answers only for a\nsession this process has activated. A session yo"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"u merely opened in the web UI is\n**cold**, so the old single-path code returned `session \"…\" not fou"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"nd` (404) for\nevery session that was visibly on screen. `openSkillView()` covers both: a live\nagent "},{"id":"p15s5","text":"becomes the scope and `ctx.agentPresets.serviceFor(agent, \"skills\")` picks\nthe registry; a cold sess"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"ion is read with\n`ctx.sessionQuery.observeSession(id, { projectionMode })` (→ `header.cwd`,\n`project"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"ions.values.agentPreset`) and given a standing scope from\n`ctx.agentPresets.acquireScope(preset)`, b"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"ecause listing skills for a session\nthat never entered the process still needs one. Each handle is r"},{"id":"p15s9","text":"eleased in a\n`finally` (`Symbol.dispose` / `Symbol.asyncDispose`) — an unreleased scope pins\nthe pre"},{"id":"p15s10","text":"set registry. `SESSION_QUERY_SESSION_NOT_FOUND` maps to 404, any other\nquery failure to 500, and hos"},{"id":"p15s11","text":"ts without `sessionQuery` fall back to\n`sessions.get()`. **Symptom to remember:** a 200 response wit"},{"id":"p15s12","text":"h `skills: []`,\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Sidebar"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The plugin registers a tab in the **official DSH right sidebar** (dsh ≥ 0.2),\nin two stages — both m"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"sters a tab in the **official DSH right sidebar** (dsh ≥ 0.2),\nin two stages — both must be correct:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"1. **Page type** — `ctx.sidebarRightTabs.register({ id: \"dsh-skill-select\", kind: \"skill-select\", pr"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"iority: \"extension\", title: () => \"Skills\", guide: [{ id: \"dsh-skill-select\", order: 70, /* … */ ico"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"n: SkillIcon }] })`.\n`kind` is the discriminator `ctx.sidebarRight.openTab(kind)` uses; the\n`guide` "},{"id":"p18s4","text":"entry is what shows **Skills** on the sidebar guide page.\n`guide[].id` is required — two entries wit"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"hout an `id` throw\n\"duplicate guide entry id\".\n2. **Keyed slots** — `ctx.slots.register({ name: \"sid"},{"id":"p18s6","text":"ebar.right.pane.tab\", key: \"dsh-skill-select\", inject: () => ({ rootCtx: ctx }) }, SkillSelectTab)`\n"},{"id":"p18s7","text":"for the body and `sidebar.right.pane.tab.title` for the pill title. The\nslot `key` must equal the st"},{"id":"p18s8","text":"age-1 **id**, not the kind; a list-shaped\n`{id, order}` on a keyed slot is a failed registration. Bo"},{"id":"p18s9","text":"th registrations\nrun inside `ctx.effect(...)` via `ctx.slots.inject(slotName, cb)`, so load\norder ca"},{"id":"p18s10","text":"s\nrun inside `ctx.effect(...)` via `ctx.slots.inject(slotName, cb)`, so load\norder can't break them."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Open the right sidebar and pick **Skills** on the guide page.\n`ctx.sidebarRight.openTab(\"skill-selec"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"t\")` always expands the sidebar and\nthrows while no Session is on screen. The tab body receives `ses"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"sionId` plus\n`useTabInfo()`, gates its skill fetch on `tab.visible`, and resets the\nsession's checks"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"useTabInfo()`, gates its skill fetch on `tab.visible`, and resets the\nsession's checks on hide→show."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"No third-party sidebar and no self-drawn fallback UI: without the official\nsidebar there is simply n"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"rd-party sidebar and no self-drawn fallback UI: without the official\nsidebar there is simply no tab."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Develop"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Design: `docs/design.md`."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
